        "body": "Pony AI Inc. describes itself as a global autonomous driving technology company pursuing autonomous mobility. It says it is developing autonomous driving systems built around a core technology it calls the \"virtual driver,\" and it organizes its work into three business units: Robotaxi, Robotruck, and Personally Owned Vehicles (POV). The company states it was founded in 2016 in Silicon Valley and has secured licenses and credentials to test and operate autonomous vehicles in multiple locations. It reports that its autonomous vehicles had traveled over 32 million kilometers (over 13 million miles) on urban roads and highways as of April 2024, and that it has accumulated millions of kilometers in autonomous road testing.\n\nPony AI Inc. is a for-profit public company with the ticker PONY and CIK 0001969302. Its headquarters is listed as Guangzhou, F4. No litigation cases or MCP servers are associated with the company in the available data.",
